1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:05,046
Over high mountains and across valleys

2
00:00:05,407 --> 00:00:08,613
A ninja flies freely in the sky like an airplane

3
00:00:08,865 --> 00:00:12,298
Honest and kind, Hattori-kun brings joy to everyone

4
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:15,632
Eyes opened wide and little mouth kept tight

5
00:00:15,965 --> 00:00:19,366
Face covered up, with puffed-out cheeks

6
00:00:19,532 --> 00:00:22,690
Catching villains, agile and fast as lightning

7
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:26,457
Nabbing crooks with strange new tricks like magic

8
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:29,836
Speaking politely like poetry, full of spirit

9
00:00:31,916 --> 00:00:34,349
"Building a Ninja Room"

10
00:00:43,621 --> 00:00:46,655
It's way too noisy! I can't study at all

11
00:00:46,706 --> 00:00:48,069
Please stop making noise

12
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:50,818
Ah, stop being so noisy...

13
00:00:51,575 --> 00:00:53,382
Out... Get out!

14
00:00:55,783 --> 00:00:58,990
Hattori-kun, I still can't concentrate on studying

15
00:00:59,041 --> 00:01:00,786
Yan... Very well

16
00:01:00,836 --> 00:01:02,300
I'll leave now

17
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:07,085
Great, now it's totally quiet

18
00:01:12,212 --> 00:01:14,698
Hey, when did you guys sneak in here?

19
00:01:17,601 --> 00:01:20,312
I've got to find a way to deal with them

20
00:01:23,838 --> 00:01:25,779
It's so cold!

21
00:01:25,970 --> 00:01:27,507
This is just a small lesson

22
00:01:27,557 --> 00:01:29,733
I told you not to mess with me anymore

23
00:01:29,784 --> 00:01:31,191
We're sorry

24
00:01:43,128 --> 00:01:45,569
Yesterday it was quiet enough for me to study

25
00:01:45,610 --> 00:01:47,741
From now on, you guys sleep outside like that

26
00:01:48,853 --> 00:01:50,394
Yan...

27
00:01:51,701 --> 00:01:53,455
Good morning, how is everyone?

28
00:01:54,295 --> 00:01:55,994
Hattori-kun, where did you sleep last night?

29
00:01:56,035 --> 00:01:59,027
Don't worry, Mom. I can sleep anywhere

30
00:02:01,266 --> 00:02:03,764
Kenichi, you have to get along nicely with everyone

31
00:02:03,821 --> 00:02:05,998
But my room is way too small

32
00:02:06,049 --> 00:02:06,965
Unless...

33
00:02:07,006 --> 00:02:09,291
If you don't expect me to study hard, that'd be different

34
00:02:09,341 --> 00:02:10,143
What did you say?

35
00:02:10,193 --> 00:02:12,578
How can you say that? That's unacceptable!

36
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:14,197
No need to worry

37
00:02:14,247 --> 00:02:16,720
I'll find a way to get a room of my own

38
00:02:16,761 --> 00:02:18,290
Huh? Get a room to stay in?

39
00:02:18,343 --> 00:02:19,211
How are you going to find one?

40
00:02:19,261 --> 00:02:20,560
Do you mean you'll buy one?

41
00:02:20,610 --> 00:02:22,460
All right, listen up Shinzo

42
00:02:22,510 --> 00:02:24,802
Try your best not to disturb Kenichi's studying, okay?

43
00:02:24,843 --> 00:02:27,520
We won't make noise anymore, right Shishimaru?

44
00:02:34,662 --> 00:02:36,638
I just feel so cramped in here

45
00:02:36,679 --> 00:02:38,686
All right, let's all go to sleep

46
00:02:39,526 --> 00:02:41,542
Yan...

47
00:02:51,137 --> 00:02:53,077
Why is Shinzo the only one here?

48
00:02:53,128 --> 00:02:56,097
Hattori-kun is gone, that's really strange

49
00:02:59,859 --> 00:03:00,905
Good morning

50
00:03:02,203 --> 00:03:03,706
Oh, what's the matter, Officer?

51
00:03:03,757 --> 00:03:04,771
We've noticed that in this area...

52
00:03:04,821 --> 00:03:07,199
A burglar has frequently been paying visits at night lately

53
00:03:07,274 --> 00:03:09,297
Have you had anything go missing?

54
00:03:09,348 --> 00:03:10,312
Hey, Mom

55
00:03:10,505 --> 00:03:13,208
Where did the wood I put in the storage room go?

56
00:03:13,641 --> 00:03:15,884
This burglar is really bizarre

57
00:03:16,161 --> 00:03:17,808
Stealing lumber, of all things!

58
00:03:17,849 --> 00:03:18,620
Anyway, ma'am

59
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,385
Please be mindful of your doors and windows at night

60
00:03:20,426 --> 00:03:21,498
All right, I'll be going now

61
00:03:23,834 --> 00:03:25,248
A burglar in the middle of the night?

62
00:03:25,299 --> 00:03:26,435
Could it be Hattori-kun?

63
00:03:26,486 --> 00:03:29,032
Right, maybe he's trying to get money to buy a house

64
00:03:29,083 --> 00:03:31,490
That's it, I have to find out the truth

65
00:03:34,994 --> 00:03:37,060
Even if you're fast, I'm not afraid

66
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:38,587
Because I have roller skates

67
00:03:39,485 --> 00:03:41,995
Oh no, where did Hattori-kun disappear to again?

68
00:03:44,995 --> 00:03:46,178
Yan...

69
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:48,378
After him...

70
00:03:48,705 --> 00:03:49,886
Yan...

71
00:03:49,937 --> 00:03:50,818
After him...

72
00:03:53,799 --> 00:03:55,290
Ouch, that hurts!

73
00:03:55,686 --> 00:03:56,776
Outrageous!

74
00:03:56,826 --> 00:03:58,770
Roller-skating all over the street in the middle of the night?

75
00:03:58,821 --> 00:04:00,138
This is completely absurd!

76
00:04:02,012 --> 00:04:03,618
Yan...

77
00:04:05,999 --> 00:04:08,499
I clearly saw him go into this house just now

78
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:10,185
Wait, this is my house!

79
00:04:10,236 --> 00:04:13,039
So the burglar every night was Hattori-kun all along!

80
00:04:13,428 --> 00:04:14,938
We caught the burglar!

81
00:04:14,988 --> 00:04:16,978
We just caught him at the park

82
00:04:20,635 --> 00:04:22,475
How could you cause such a fuss?

83
00:04:22,588 --> 00:04:24,872
I'm really sorry, it's all our fault for not checking properly

84
00:04:24,912 --> 00:04:26,100
In any case, I'm very sorry

85
00:04:26,151 --> 00:04:27,303
I told you so from the start

86
00:04:27,353 --> 00:04:29,520
How could Hattori-kun ever be a thief?

87
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:33,893
Speaking of which...

88
00:04:33,951 --> 00:04:35,902
Where on earth did Hattori-kun go?

89
00:04:35,953 --> 00:04:37,137
I have a theory

90
00:04:37,187 --> 00:04:38,516
Maybe Kenichi went too far

91
00:04:38,566 --> 00:04:40,750
Doing that must have been really hard on Hattori-kun

92
00:04:40,791 --> 00:04:43,216
So he got mad and ran away from home

93
00:04:44,329 --> 00:04:45,676
That's true

94
00:04:45,727 --> 00:04:49,126
Even Hattori-kun's luggage and desk are gone!

95
00:04:50,237 --> 00:04:52,750
Big Brother, you abandoned me!

96
00:04:52,791 --> 00:04:55,591
Where on earth are you?

97
00:04:55,684 --> 00:04:56,824
Yan...

98
00:05:03,474 --> 00:05:04,705
Huh? Big Brother?

99
00:05:04,791 --> 00:05:06,398
Oh, yan...

100
00:05:07,032 --> 00:05:09,233
Oh dear, this is so baffling

101
00:05:09,426 --> 00:05:11,858
I secretly built a room, you see

102
00:05:13,530 --> 00:05:14,490
Yan!

103
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:18,850
What?

104
00:05:19,558 --> 00:05:21,199
How could you even pull off something like that?

105
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:25,452
When did you make a place like this?

106
00:05:26,219 --> 00:05:28,178
I'm sorry, please forgive me

107
00:05:28,392 --> 00:05:31,676
I used the wood Dad left in the storage room as materials

108
00:05:31,726 --> 00:05:34,110
Because I didn't want to disturb Kenichi's studying anymore

109
00:05:34,161 --> 00:05:35,979
I plan to live right here

110
00:05:36,952 --> 00:05:39,583
So that's what you meant when you said you wanted a room?

111
00:05:39,633 --> 00:05:41,592
I'm sorry for making you all worry

112
00:05:41,643 --> 00:05:43,338
The room is very crude

113
00:05:44,427 --> 00:05:47,178
Wow, it's actually really nice!

114
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:49,324
Hattori-kun

115
00:05:49,364 --> 00:05:51,309
I want to live here too, can I?

116
00:05:51,359 --> 00:05:52,582
No way, no way

117
00:05:52,632 --> 00:05:54,650
Kenichi should stay in the room downstairs

118
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:56,323
That's the only way you'll study hard

119
00:05:56,374 --> 00:05:57,270
That's right

120
00:05:58,848 --> 00:06:02,602
Shishimaru, we have our own room! Yay!

121
00:06:05,810 --> 00:06:06,994
Be careful, you two

122
00:06:07,044 --> 00:06:10,018
This door leads outside

123
00:06:14,015 --> 00:06:15,722
Help!

124
00:06:16,277 --> 00:06:17,577
Oh, I'm so sorry

125
00:06:17,618 --> 00:06:19,067
I forgot to nail this board down

126
00:06:19,108 --> 00:06:21,663
That's why this happened, I'm very sorry

127
00:06:21,704 --> 00:06:23,296
Help...

128
00:06:23,337 --> 00:06:26,401
I'm no master carpenter, so things are bound to get missed

129
00:06:28,806 --> 00:06:31,093
"Shishimaru Goes Missing"

130
00:06:42,350 --> 00:06:45,096
- It's huge!
- Oh, I see a cavity!

131
00:06:51,464 --> 00:06:53,255
It's so cute...

132
00:06:54,068 --> 00:06:56,885
Oh, that monkey looks just like Kenichi!

133
00:06:56,936 --> 00:06:58,821
They really look like brothers

134
00:07:00,887 --> 00:07:03,210
So alike... completely identical!

135
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:19,025
All right, let's picnic here, okay?

136
00:07:19,297 --> 00:07:20,944
- Agreed!
- Okay!

137
00:07:21,891 --> 00:07:23,930
Where did Shishimaru go?

138
00:07:23,981 --> 00:07:25,530
Oh, you're right

139
00:07:25,571 --> 00:07:27,770
He must have wandered off and gotten lost

140
00:07:28,832 --> 00:07:31,075
They look so majestic!

141
00:07:38,944 --> 00:07:40,836
Truly majestic

142
00:07:54,164 --> 00:07:55,990
There's Shishimaru!

143
00:07:58,329 --> 00:07:59,169
Shishimaru

144
00:07:59,210 --> 00:08:00,823
It's getting late now

145
00:08:01,150 --> 00:08:02,523
I know eating is your favourite thing

146
00:08:02,574 --> 00:08:04,330
Come with me, okay?

147
00:08:04,770 --> 00:08:06,143
Oh, really?

148
00:08:09,726 --> 00:08:11,538
- Delicious...
- So yummy...

149
00:08:12,466 --> 00:08:15,391
- So tasty... delicious
- It really is good, isn't it?

150
00:08:16,323 --> 00:08:17,698
I'm so bored

151
00:08:19,605 --> 00:08:22,280
- We had so much fun today!
- I'm so tired

152
00:08:22,331 --> 00:08:24,818
You played so hard, of course you're tired

153
00:08:35,375 --> 00:08:36,643
What's that sound?

154
00:08:37,196 --> 00:08:38,677
Shishimaru!

155
00:08:39,861 --> 00:08:42,538
Shishimaru? Huh...

156
00:08:42,836 --> 00:08:45,016
Where did Shishimaru go?

157
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:51,055
"I have gone to seek a master and learn skills. -Shishimaru"

158
00:08:51,675 --> 00:08:53,205
Shishimaru ran away from home?

159
00:08:53,246 --> 00:08:56,421
- Shishimaru, Shishimaru!
- Shishimaru, Shishimaru!

160
00:08:56,915 --> 00:08:59,018
- Shishimaru!
- Shishimaru!

161
00:08:59,454 --> 00:09:01,172
Hey, Shishimaru!

162
00:09:01,223 --> 00:09:02,889
Shishimaru!

163
00:09:04,992 --> 00:09:06,878
Where on earth did Shishimaru go?

164
00:09:06,978 --> 00:09:08,145
What should we do?

165
00:09:09,791 --> 00:09:11,152
Yan...

166
00:09:11,202 --> 00:09:13,496
There's nothing we can do, we can't find him

167
00:09:13,547 --> 00:09:14,376
That's right

168
00:09:14,427 --> 00:09:16,900
Actually, he looked bored all day today

169
00:09:22,038 --> 00:09:25,138
That's it! I know where Shishimaru is. Excuse me!

170
00:09:27,770 --> 00:09:29,130
Yan...

171
00:09:30,049 --> 00:09:31,476
Yan...

172
00:09:36,042 --> 00:09:37,418
Who's there?

173
00:09:40,569 --> 00:09:44,551
Here I am! Hello, big brothers!

174
00:09:45,218 --> 00:09:47,401
Who on earth are you?

175
00:09:49,284 --> 00:09:50,989
My name is Shishimaru

176
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:53,580
To tell you the truth, I've always wanted to be a real lion

177
00:09:53,630 --> 00:09:54,874
Shishimaru?

178
00:09:54,924 --> 00:09:56,923
You want to become a lion?

179
00:09:56,974 --> 00:09:57,651
Yes

180
00:09:57,691 --> 00:09:59,960
So I would like to take you two as my masters

181
00:10:00,277 --> 00:10:02,110
You want to be our disciple?

182
00:10:07,303 --> 00:10:08,260
We could take you on as a disciple

183
00:10:08,310 --> 00:10:10,642
But our training is very strict

184
00:10:11,417 --> 00:10:13,523
Yes, that won't be a problem at all

185
00:10:13,564 --> 00:10:16,587
Because I've been training hard in ninja arts since I was young

186
00:10:16,637 --> 00:10:17,978
I can take it!

187
00:10:18,349 --> 00:10:20,759
Huh, ninjutsu? What on earth is that?

188
00:10:21,058 --> 00:10:23,671
Uh... allow me to demonstrate

189
00:10:24,246 --> 00:10:26,966
Yan...

190
00:10:30,229 --> 00:10:32,386
All right, please pounce at me, both of you

191
00:10:32,469 --> 00:10:34,098
Here I come!

192
00:10:38,513 --> 00:10:41,246
How's that? I'm over here

193
00:10:41,722 --> 00:10:44,938
This time, please pounce at me together, come on!

194
00:10:55,942 --> 00:10:58,209
It's the ninjutsu art of Transposition!

195
00:10:59,902 --> 00:11:03,018
Next up, this is the Clone Technique!

196
00:11:03,650 --> 00:11:05,743
Watch closely, both of you!

197
00:11:19,310 --> 00:11:20,738
I'm over here!

198
00:11:21,403 --> 00:11:23,316
This move is called "Ghost Scares Ghost"!

199
00:11:36,608 --> 00:11:38,406
Wow, this is better than a movie!

200
00:11:38,456 --> 00:11:39,673
Lions are the king of beasts

201
00:11:39,723 --> 00:11:42,232
I never dreamed they'd actually be such cowards

202
00:11:42,282 --> 00:11:43,813
They're totally useless!

203
00:11:44,053 --> 00:11:45,402
Oh, that's true

204
00:11:45,453 --> 00:11:48,245
Yan... Let's just go home, Shishimaru

205
00:11:48,295 --> 00:11:50,046
Your skills are actually better than the lions'

206
00:11:50,096 --> 00:11:51,012
Why bother learning from them?

207
00:11:51,053 --> 00:11:52,317
You're right

208
00:11:53,045 --> 00:11:55,739
But we can't just leave like this

209
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:58,195
Yan...

210
00:11:58,719 --> 00:12:00,418
Nice skills!

211
00:12:01,186 --> 00:12:03,258
Dad, Mom, come look quickly!

212
00:12:03,618 --> 00:12:05,138
Take a look at Shishimaru!

213
00:12:08,569 --> 00:12:10,449
-Oh my, it's a panda!
-It's a panda!

214
00:12:11,143 --> 00:12:13,108
Do I look like one or not?

215
00:12:15,408 --> 00:12:17,171
Shishimaru couldn't disguise himself as a real lion

216
00:12:17,227 --> 00:12:18,456
But disguising as a panda

217
00:12:18,507 --> 00:12:20,753
He actually pulled it off pretty well

218
00:12:26,210 --> 00:12:28,698
"The Breath of Autumn"

219
00:12:40,514 --> 00:12:42,133
Quiet down, everyone, stop making noise

220
00:12:42,183 --> 00:12:43,866
You have two hours for outdoor sketching

221
00:12:43,916 --> 00:12:46,193
It's autumn scenery, so you can paint whatever you like

222
00:12:46,243 --> 00:12:48,168
The most important thing is to capture the breath of autumn

223
00:12:48,208 --> 00:12:49,000
That's all that matters

224
00:12:49,050 --> 00:12:50,763
Remember, don't wander off too far

225
00:12:50,813 --> 00:12:52,143
All right, you may begin now

226
00:12:55,909 --> 00:12:57,351
What does "the breath of autumn" mean?

227
00:12:57,392 --> 00:12:59,252
-What is it like?
-Look at the park

228
00:12:59,293 --> 00:13:00,692
That has the breath of autumn right there

229
00:13:00,743 --> 00:13:01,843
The trees, the grass...

230
00:13:01,893 --> 00:13:03,541
They completely express the breath of autumn!

231
00:13:03,592 --> 00:13:04,396
Really?

232
00:13:04,446 --> 00:13:05,423
Even the grass?

233
00:13:05,473 --> 00:13:06,578
Of course!

234
00:13:06,945 --> 00:13:08,139
Then... is this it?

235
00:13:08,197 --> 00:13:09,127
Yeah...

236
00:13:10,584 --> 00:13:12,538
Ahh, so scary!

237
00:13:13,979 --> 00:13:16,773
Kenichi, you have no gentleness or manners at all!

238
00:13:16,814 --> 00:13:17,656
Oh right, Yumeko

239
00:13:17,706 --> 00:13:19,311
I saw a lot of chrysanthemums over there

240
00:13:19,352 --> 00:13:21,195
Where? Take me to see them

241
00:13:21,246 --> 00:13:22,482
Come with me

242
00:13:22,523 --> 00:13:24,989
The two of us can paint there while we're at it

243
00:13:25,039 --> 00:13:26,029
Great, let's go!

244
00:13:26,079 --> 00:13:26,952
Let's go right now

245
00:13:26,993 --> 00:13:28,537
That's wonderful!

246
00:13:28,588 --> 00:13:29,538
Really?

247
00:13:33,211 --> 00:13:36,403
All right, I definitely have to find the feeling of autumn

248
00:13:42,233 --> 00:13:44,118
Someone's burning fallen leaves

249
00:13:44,175 --> 00:13:46,492
That's it, that's the feeling of autumn

250
00:13:55,924 --> 00:13:57,304
Ready to eat!

251
00:14:02,282 --> 00:14:04,943
Ugh, ruined my mood completely

252
00:14:05,199 --> 00:14:07,917
Man, what really is the feeling of autumn?

253
00:14:10,972 --> 00:14:12,843
I feel so tired now

254
00:14:17,212 --> 00:14:19,393
There are so many white clouds in the sky, that's it

255
00:14:19,443 --> 00:14:21,548
Fluffy white clouds are the feeling of autumn

256
00:14:21,612 --> 00:14:23,110
All right, I'll definitely paint this

257
00:14:27,481 --> 00:14:29,988
Ouch, my back and bones ache now

258
00:14:36,516 --> 00:14:37,410
Oh no...

259
00:14:41,608 --> 00:14:42,886
The clouds are all gone

260
00:14:42,937 --> 00:14:44,913
I'm only halfway done with my painting

261
00:14:44,963 --> 00:14:46,219
Oh, a grasshopper!

262
00:14:46,325 --> 00:14:48,743
An autumn insect, wonderful!

263
00:14:50,595 --> 00:14:52,163
Hey... wait, don't run away!

264
00:14:52,213 --> 00:14:54,328
Hey... don't move, come here

265
00:14:55,003 --> 00:14:56,818
Hey... don't move!

266
00:14:59,902 --> 00:15:01,123
Ah, don't move!

267
00:15:01,181 --> 00:15:02,817
You really don't listen, do you?

268
00:15:03,879 --> 00:15:04,983
Hey...

269
00:15:07,536 --> 00:15:09,303
Kenichi, what are you doing?

270
00:15:09,483 --> 00:15:10,968
Summer is already over

271
00:15:11,018 --> 00:15:11,962
You're still swimming?

272
00:15:12,003 --> 00:15:14,370
Ah, Hattori-kun, what are you doing here?

273
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:17,023
I'm doomed to fail this time

274
00:15:17,359 --> 00:15:18,876
Don't worry, I understand

275
00:15:18,926 --> 00:15:21,547
This kind of problem is easy to solve, let me help you

276
00:15:21,674 --> 00:15:22,888
How are you going to help me?

277
00:15:22,939 --> 00:15:24,822
I'll find an ideal spot

278
00:15:24,872 --> 00:15:27,332
for you to capture the feeling of autumn

279
00:15:28,162 --> 00:15:31,698
Yan...

280
00:15:32,964 --> 00:15:33,571
Let's see

281
00:15:33,611 --> 00:15:35,863
What trick is Hattori-kun trying this time?

282
00:15:37,130 --> 00:15:40,170
In just a moment, you'll see the autumn scenery

283
00:15:41,977 --> 00:15:44,458
It's the Iga ninja Leaf Dyeing Technique

284
00:15:46,050 --> 00:15:47,498
Yan...

285
00:15:58,860 --> 00:16:00,292
No matter how I paint it, it doesn't look right

286
00:16:00,342 --> 00:16:01,880
Shishimaru, what should I do?

287
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:04,360
Delicious!

288
00:16:06,781 --> 00:16:08,848
Hey... you can't do that!

289
00:16:08,906 --> 00:16:11,341
The paint's all gone, all that effort wasted!

290
00:16:14,787 --> 00:16:17,113
Does autumn give you an extra big appetite?

291
00:16:17,473 --> 00:16:19,108
That kind of feeling is really hard to paint

292
00:16:19,156 --> 00:16:21,970
Hurry up and go, I've found an autumn view!

293
00:16:22,011 --> 00:16:23,250
Really? Let's hurry...

294
00:16:23,291 --> 00:16:24,603
Wait for me!

295
00:16:25,132 --> 00:16:26,589
It's this tree right here

296
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:28,882
Huh? Where's the feeling of autumn?

297
00:16:28,923 --> 00:16:31,383
Oh, that's weird, why?

298
00:16:31,578 --> 00:16:33,216
Ah, did it revert on its own?

299
00:16:35,867 --> 00:16:38,021
So it was Kemumaki playing tricks, was it?

300
00:16:38,062 --> 00:16:40,017
It's the Koga ninja Washing Technique!

301
00:16:40,068 --> 00:16:41,911
A squirt of water from my bottle sorts everything out

302
00:16:41,961 --> 00:16:43,475
Hattori-kun, let's see what you've got

303
00:16:43,526 --> 00:16:45,702
Agh, you're really despicable!

304
00:16:46,675 --> 00:16:47,881
Let me show you what I can do!

305
00:16:47,931 --> 00:16:49,827
It's the Iga ninja Chestnut Shuriken!

306
00:16:52,183 --> 00:16:55,250
- It's the Koga ninja Soft Persimmon Shuriken!
- Yan...

307
00:16:55,419 --> 00:16:57,197
Hey, don't run away!

308
00:16:57,485 --> 00:16:59,538
Had enough yet...?

309
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:03,314
Yan... not scared...

310
00:17:04,610 --> 00:17:06,044
Kenichi, are you all right?

311
00:17:06,094 --> 00:17:07,060
Are you okay?

312
00:17:07,101 --> 00:17:08,357
Have another one!

313
00:17:08,664 --> 00:17:10,097
Here comes another!

314
00:17:13,929 --> 00:17:15,442
So bitter!

315
00:17:17,423 --> 00:17:19,713
Using rotten soft persimmons as shuriken?

316
00:17:19,893 --> 00:17:21,702
What should I do? My drawing isn't finished yet

317
00:17:21,753 --> 00:17:24,779
How am I supposed to explain to the teacher later? What do you say?

318
00:17:25,421 --> 00:17:27,180
You're pretty hopeless. Look at mine

319
00:17:27,230 --> 00:17:28,332
I'm already finished

320
00:17:28,383 --> 00:17:30,143
Kemumaki, you're too despicable!

321
00:17:30,184 --> 00:17:32,312
No need to be so mad, you've got company

322
00:17:32,353 --> 00:17:34,796
Because Kemumaki's drawing isn't finished at all

323
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:35,836
Oh no, this is bad

324
00:17:35,884 --> 00:17:38,578
Those chestnuts from earlier must have messed up the drawing

325
00:17:40,952 --> 00:17:41,762
All finished

326
00:17:41,813 --> 00:17:42,885
Let me see

327
00:17:44,169 --> 00:17:45,502
- It's so pretty
- Yeah, it looks great

328
00:17:45,561 --> 00:17:47,270
- You're awful!
- You're just as bad!

329
00:17:47,311 --> 00:17:48,714
- You're the worst!
- It's you!

330
00:17:48,755 --> 00:17:50,492
- It's all your fault for ruining mine!
- You're the worst!

331
00:17:50,533 --> 00:17:51,851
- Look at this!
- What do you want?

332
00:17:51,988 --> 00:17:53,145
- What do you mean what do I want?
- So infuriating!

333
00:17:53,186 --> 00:17:54,574
- It's totally your fault!
- Seriously? What's your problem?

334
00:17:54,615 --> 00:17:56,439
- You think you're so smart?
- Yeah, you think you're so great?

335
00:17:56,638 --> 00:17:58,252
I'm not wasting my breath on you

336
00:17:58,692 --> 00:18:00,022
- Ouch!
- Hey, what are you doing?

337
00:18:00,073 --> 00:18:01,705
Hey, what are you two arguing about?

338
00:18:03,783 --> 00:18:04,895
What's going on? Oh no!

339
00:18:04,946 --> 00:18:06,335
That drawing must have looked too real

340
00:18:06,386 --> 00:18:08,201
Did it get eaten? What a shame

341
00:18:08,251 --> 00:18:09,896
Your masterpieces are both gone too

342
00:18:10,332 --> 00:18:13,865
- What a real shame
- Oh dear, that drawing was so pretty, such a shame

343
00:18:14,143 --> 00:18:15,565
You can just draw it again next time

344
00:18:17,192 --> 00:18:20,121
Kenichi, fortune favors the good. Everything's fine now

345
00:18:20,161 --> 00:18:21,378
Yan...
